          "3. A JAC aircraft with type code AT72 showed an indication of flight control malfunction at Kagoshima on November 22.",
          "4. Fumes were reported on board a TAP Airbus A321neo (A21N) near Madrid on November 22.",
          "5. A Seychelles DHC-6 Twin Otter (ICAO type code DHC6) had a runway excursion on landing at Victoria on November 22.",
          "6. A strange odour was reported on board an American Boeing 737-800 (ICAO type code B738) near Santiago on November 22."
        ]
